# Production build default.
#
# This is public, non-secret configuration: the browser needs to know the API
# origin. When the site is built on Render, the static site's `VITE_API_BASE_URL`
# build environment variable takes precedence over this file (Vite lets
# `process.env` override `.env` files), so the deployed value is authoritative.
# This file is only a fallback for producing a production bundle locally.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://transform-api-7b3g.onrender.com/api
